# Security AI Agent — Docker build context filter
# Affects: deployments/prod/docker/Dockerfile.api + Dockerfile.frontend
# (both use repo root as the build context)
#
# Goals:
#   - Exclude .pyc / __pycache__ / .venv / cache dirs to shrink build context
#   - Exclude tests / docs / editor configs
#   - API image does not need frontend/ or agent/ sources
#   - Frontend image does not need src/ (Python) or agent/ (Go)
#   - Both images still need deployments/prod/docker/ (scripts + config)
#   - Exclude .git/ to keep git history out of the image

# ---- Python cache ----
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.egg-info/
*.egg
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ---- Python venv ----
.venv/
.venv312/
.goworks/
.coverage
.coverage.*

# ---- Tests / docs / scratch ----
tests/
docs/
*.md
E2E_TEST_REPORT.md
enroll_token.json
openapi.json

# ---- Editor / tool config ----
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.editorconfig
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/
.codex/

# ---- Scratch / misc ----
*.log
*.swp
*.bak
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- API image does not need ----
frontend/
agent/
scripts/
.openapi.json

# ---- Frontend image does not need ----
src/
agent/
docs/
scripts/
